              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi Guddaani waan jed'u, Guyyaani ind'ufa, ka ch'ubbichafi nami ufi saaduleeni aka buuyo godde gubatu. Guyya suni worri ch'ufti gubate hobae daara d'aba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo isani, worra maqa kiyya sodaatu, d'ugaani tiyya aka adu isaniti ifsite, kayyoni isii isani jireesiti. Duuba aka yabbiye d'oqoba keesaa banani buraat'ani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba guyya anini wo tolchu, isani worra ch'ubbuu dabsattani ira ejaanjattani d'uke tolchitani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
